            "state": "translated",
            "value": "细节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dim minimized windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将最小化的窗口变暗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disable HyperDock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停用 HyperDock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distance from the Dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与程序坞的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distance from the Dock:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与程序坞的距离："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dock Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序坞项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't block Dock's autohide / magnification": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不干预程序坞的自动隐藏 / 放大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't show if there is only one app window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有一个窗口时不显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a window to a screen edge and pause to see resize recommendations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把窗口拖到屏幕边缘并停顿，即可看到尺寸建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw highlight gradient": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绘制高光渐变"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw triangle below bubble": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在气泡下方绘制三角指针"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elements:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元素："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable window previews": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用窗口预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "English": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Event": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every preference returns to its default, HyperDock stops opening at login, and your Dock's own settings are restored. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有偏好恢复默认，HyperDock 不再开机启动，你的程序坞设置也会还原。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fade": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "淡入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First full size preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次完整预览延迟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fit the screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适应屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fitting the screen picks the shape from its proportions — two windows side by side, four as 2×2, six as 3×2, eight as 4×2 — so a wide display gets a wide grid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「适应屏幕」按屏幕比例决定网格形状——两个窗口左右并排，四个 2×2，六个 3×2，八个 4×2——越宽的屏幕列数越多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fixed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full size preview delay on first activation:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次显示完整预览的延迟："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full size preview delay on subsequent activation:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后续显示完整预览的延迟："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Function": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gap between windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give one app its own bindings when it should behave differently from the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当某个应用需要不同的行为时，可为它单独设置绑定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant them in System Settings, then come back — HyperDock notices on its own, with no relaunch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「系统设置」中授权后回到这里即可，HyperDock 会自动察觉，无需重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid layout:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网格布局："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide App": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Dock app labels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏程序坞应用名称标签"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Menu Bar Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏菜单栏图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide previews after": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预览关闭延迟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the menu bar icon?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要隐藏菜单栏图标吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide when a Dock icon is clicked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击程序坞图标时隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide when a dock item is clicked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击程序坞图标时隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide when a preview is clicked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击预览时隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight the preview under the pointer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高亮指针所在的预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the keys and drag anywhere inside a window, not just its title bar. Resizing grows from the corner nearest where the drag began.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住这些键可从窗口内任意位置拖动，不限于标题栏。缩放以最靠近起始点的那个角为锚点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold these keys to move and resize a window from anywhere in it, not just the title bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住这些键即可从窗口任意位置移动和缩放，不限于标题栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hover any Dock icon to see every window that app has open — including ones you have minimized or left on another desktop — and click straight through to the one you want.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "悬停任意程序坞图标，即可看到该应用打开的所有窗口——包括你最小化的、以及留在其它桌面上的——点击就能直接切换过去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the pointer must rest on a Dock icon before previews appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针需在程序坞图标上停留多久才弹出预览。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HyperDock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HyperDock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HyperDock has no Dock icon. It lives in the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HyperDock 没有程序坞图标，它在菜单栏里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HyperDock keeps running and window previews still work. To bring the icon back, open HyperDock again from your Applications folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HyperDock 会继续运行，窗口预览依然可用。想让图标重新出现，从「应用程序」文件夹里再次打开 HyperDock 即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HyperDock keeps running in the background and starts automatically when you log in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后 HyperDock 会常驻后台运行，并在你登录时自动启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "界面语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep thumbnails live while open": {
