          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口排序依据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stacking order": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "层叠顺序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops window previews without quitting the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止窗口预览，但不退出应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to this window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到此窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect immediately — no restart needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即生效，无需重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Dock itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序坞本身"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first full size preview waits longer so it does not flash up while the pointer is merely crossing the previews. Once you are scanning, later ones come faster.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次完整预览等待较久，避免指针只是掠过时闪现；进入连续浏览后，后续预览会更快出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar icon can be hidden, and ⌘, only reaches an app that is in front — which HyperDock never is. This shortcut always works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏图标可以被隐藏，而 ⌘, 只对前台应用有效——HyperDock 从不在前台。这个快捷键始终可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This changes your Dock's own setting and restarts it briefly. Turning it off restores the system default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会修改并短暂重启你的程序坞本身的设置。关闭后恢复系统默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbnail quality:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩略图质量："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbnails": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩略图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tile Windows in a Grid": {
      "localizations": {
